--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. ROPgadget
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

rop-finder is a port of ROPgadget (https://github.com/JonathanSalwan/ROPgadget).
It is a derivative work: the gadget anchor tables, the `passClean` filter, the
gadget-assembly and depth-walk semantics, and the x86/x64 `ropmaker` ROP-chain
construction logic were re-implemented in Rust from ROPgadget's Python sources,
and are cited by name in comments throughout crates/. The 24 files under
tests/fixtures/ are byte-identical copies of ROPgadget's test-suite-binaries/,
used as the parity corpus. ROPgadget itself is not bundled, modified or
redistributed by this repository.

Upstream version this port tracks: ROPgadget v7.7, at commit
b6e3fe31af46d7e045fef99a3ab19ccbcea5c2f6 of
https://github.com/JonathanSalwan/ropgadget.git.

